    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the world of the Endless Palace</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BERENICE</strong> is a gothic horror roguelite where every step is a trial, and the palace around you lives its own mysterious life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Herman</strong>, a hunter trapped inside the <strong>Endless Palace</strong>, forced to fight for survival in a world where <strong>architecture defies the laws of physics</strong> and <strong>shadows whisper thoughts that aren\u2019t yours</strong>.<br>His goal: his long-lost beloved, <strong>Berenice</strong>, whose voice echoes through a labyrinth of halls, bridges, and arches.<br>But the palace will not let him go so easily...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedurally endless palace</strong><br>Each section reshapes itself - there is no path to memorize. You can only move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three major biomes -</strong>\u00a0Edinburgh, the Sunken City, and the Palace Vaults<br>Each with its own logic, mood, and lore-bound boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible combat and weapon builds -\u00a0</strong>Pick up, discard, adapt on the go. Every weapon has its own durability and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive memories -</strong>Unlock fragments of the past through the journal. Control shadows. Customize the face of Berenice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A philosophical story of order, fear, and obsession -\u00a0</strong>Herman searches for peace - but the deeper he goes, the more the palace becomes him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio as orientation -\u00a0</strong>Silence deceives. Hums guide. Berenice\u2019s voice calls - but where?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just a horror-action game.\u00a0</strong>It\u2019s a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Where do you go when the path never ends?</i></strong></p>",
